      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm just reviewing our HACCP docs for the new catering contract. can u give me the exact temp and time requirements for cooling down cooked poultry? specifically need to make sure we're hitting the right marks to stop clostridium perfringens from growing. thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
